### Create Kanban column
POST http://localhost:8080/api/columns
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "To Do",
  "board": {
    "id": 1
  }
}

### Existing board
GET http://localhost:8080/api/columns/search?boardId=1

### Nonexistent board
GET http://localhost:8080/api/columns/search?boardId=9999

### Update Kanban column
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/columns/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Backlog"
}

### Delete Kanban column
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/columns/3

### Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks

### Create task
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Build Task API",
  "description": "Connect React to Spring Boot",
  "priority": "High",
  "column": {
    "id": 4
  }
}

### Get existing task
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/23

### Get nonexistent task
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/9999

